{"sections":[{"slug":"谱(代数)","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"谱(代数)"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">谱</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">代数</span>–<span lang=\"zh\">几何对偶</span>)"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">观念</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"谱 (代数–几何对偶)"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"观念"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">本页面谈论</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/代数-几何对偶","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">代数</span>–<span lang=\"zh\">几何对偶</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">中的</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">谱</span>” <span lang=\"zh\">的广泛概念</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">同伦论中的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/谱","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">谱</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">与这个概念没有从属关系</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">只是不幸地占有同一个名称</span>. (<span lang=\"zh\">更不幸的是</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">谱代数几何要讨论</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/环谱","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">环谱</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的谱</span>…)</p>\n<hr />\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">谱是一种与代数</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/代数-几何对偶","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">对偶</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的对象</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">这里的</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">代数</span>” <span lang=\"zh\">是非常广泛的概念</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">不限于</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/结合代数","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">结合代数</span>"}},{"Plain":". <span lang=\"zh\">通常</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">某种代数的谱</span> $\\operatorname{Spec}A$ <span lang=\"zh\">满足这样的性质</span>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">代数同态</span> $A \\to B$ <span lang=\"zh\">对应于谱的映射</span> $\\operatorname{Spec}B\\to \\operatorname{Spec} A$. (<span lang=\"zh\">这一事实有时可直接作为函子</span> $\\operatorname{Spec}$ <span lang=\"zh\">的定义</span>.)</li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">特别地</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">若</span> $\\operatorname{Spec}B$ <span lang=\"zh\">是一个类似于</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">点</span>” <span lang=\"zh\">的几何对象</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">也就是其中没有</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">更小</span>” <span lang=\"zh\">的部分</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">意味着</span> $B$ <span lang=\"zh\">是一个不能</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">更小</span>” <span lang=\"zh\">的代数</span>), <span lang=\"zh\">那么代数同态</span> $A\\to B$ <span lang=\"zh\">给出了</span> $\\operatorname{Spec}A$ <span lang=\"zh\">的一个</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">点</span>”. <span lang=\"zh\">这个事实有时是</span> $\\operatorname{Spec}A$ <span lang=\"zh\">的定义</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">交换代数</span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">交换环的谱是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/仿射概形","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">仿射概形</span>"}},{"Plain":".</li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">交换</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/C-星代数","text":"C*-<span lang=\"zh\">代数</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的谱是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/紧Hausdorff空间","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">紧</span> Hausdorff <span lang=\"zh\">空间</span>"}},{"Plain":".</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">逻辑学中的代数</span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>"},{"Local":{"url":"/Boole代数","text":"Boole <span lang=\"zh\">代数</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的谱是其</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Stone对偶","text":"Stone <span lang=\"zh\">对偶</span>"}},{"Plain":".</li>\n<li>"},{"Local":{"url":"/位象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">位象</span>"}},{"Plain":" …</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">综合代数几何</span></h3>\n<p>…</p>\n"}]}}}]}